+ * assembled; reproduced to the digit by dropping that chevron): the factors
+ * are those of another matrix and the eigenvalues are wrong without any
+ * message. The check solves one pseudo random right hand side with the new
+ * factors and compares A x with b with the matrix that was handed to SPOOLES
+ * (the entries that spooles_factor puts into the InpMtx object). The measure
+ * is the ROW-WISE backward error
+ *     eta = max_i |b_i - (A x)_i| / ( sum_j |a_ij| |x_j| + |b_i| )
